scenario two consecutive fixes imply a speed nothing on a wrist reaches
describe About 5.5 km between epochs one second apart. Nothing the device is
describe strapped to travels at 5.5 km/s, so either the receiver is wrong or
describe somebody is lying to it, and both are reasons not to navigate by it.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion moving watch
  expect trust trusted

at 1000
  fix 3d
  pos 5500000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion moving watch
  expect reason position-jump
  expect trust degraded

# The receiver's own speed field agreeing makes it worse, not better: now two
# independent numbers say the impossible thing.
at 2000
  fix 3d
  pos 5990000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  speed 5400000
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion moving watch
  expect reason position-jump
  expect reason implausible-speed
  expect trust untrusted
